            "review_text": "SaigonJoe72\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam44 contributions\n3\nGood Food\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nFood is really good, beef was tender and tasty. It is way to expensive for what you get and not enough staff to take care of the customers. Also, there was one really ugly fat guy and two friends getting so drunk and abusing the staff and the staff let them get away with it. Also the ugly fat guy was tell the staff the people sitting near him that their butts were in his face and the staff made the other customers move. He even throw something at one of the waiters taking orders from someone else and told him to come to him and the waiter did. I could not believe the rudeness of this man. Because of him and the way the staff handled it the two stars and never go there again. This is the new shop on Mac Dien Chi street.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 7, 2019",
